WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:09.676
{\an8}[Brother] Uh. our info is limited.
these guys aren't in our database.

2
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.347
{\an8}All we really know is that they came
from Guangzhou. China.

3
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.891
{\an8}I'm still investigating
to get the exact details.

4
00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:17.935
{\an8}How close are we on the server?

5
00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.938
I still got. uh. two-thirds or more?

6
00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.273
And the shopping mall migration?

7
00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:25.901
Seventy percent.
It's 'cause we're only working nights.

8
00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:28.445
We have to avoid any tracking by Babylon.

9
00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:31.949
I have to go get Jian myself.

10
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.577
Those bastards are gonna
go after her quickly.

11
00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:37.621
What's that?

12
00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:40.207
I think they already found us.

13
00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:45.212
[engines rumbling]

14
00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.214
[♪ soft tense music playing]

15
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.802
[tires screech]

16
00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:02.980
[♪ soft tense music playing]

17
00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:10.612
[beeps. whirs]

18
00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:13.323
[drone whirring]

19
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.074
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org

20
00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:23.834
Can't get a clear shot.

21
00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.794
Container's in the way.

22
00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:27.504
[J] <i>As expected.</i>

23
00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:29.881
Hold your positions.

24
00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:31.216
We're going in.

25
00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:35.679
[in Japanese] Listen carefully.
Put your personal grudge aside.

26
00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.181
Jeong Jinman has
to be captured alive. Translate.

27
00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:41.893
[sighs]

28
00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.856
[in English] Jeong Jinman needs
to be captured alive. sir.

29
00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.357
He has to be alive.

30
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:48.984
[sighs]

31
00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.987
[in Korean] Just don't get in my way.

32
00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:56.783
You'll die first. Translate.

33
00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:58.035
[in English] Ah. shit.

34
00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:03.123
[Marco. in Japanese] Uh… what he said was…

35
00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.584
Ah. die first?

36
00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.253
[in English] I didn't get the last part.

37
00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:09.796
[in Japanese] What?

38
00:02:13.884 --> 00:02:15.469
That… one-eyed bastard…

39
00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:17.888
[door slides open]

40
00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:18.972
[sighs]

41
00:02:19.056 --> 00:02:22.809
[♪ soft tense music playing]

42
00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:34.696
[in English]
Appreciate you working so late.

43
00:02:35.697 --> 00:02:36.698
[door closes]

44
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.038
We can begin now.

45
00:02:43.538 --> 00:02:50.545
A SHOP FOR KILLERS 2

46
00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:57.469
EPISODE 04
RAID

47
00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.179
[Jin] Understood.

48
00:02:59.721 --> 00:03:02.641
I will retrieve the asset
and put things back in order.

49
00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:05.185
[♪ upbeat music playing over speakers]

50
00:03:11.692 --> 00:03:12.693
[J sighs]

51
00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:18.949
[J] Who is it?

52
00:03:19.408 --> 00:03:22.369
Who could make the great Kusanagi act
so submissively. huh?

53
00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:23.620
[soft exhale]

54
00:03:23.704 --> 00:03:24.871
[Jin sighs]

55
00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:29.709
I can keep on climbing higher and higher.
but there's always another level.

56
00:03:29.793 --> 00:03:31.128
[chuckles softly]

57
00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.546
Don't you miss fieldwork?

58
00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:34.381
Not at all.

59
00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.425
The smell of blood…

60
00:03:36.508 --> 00:03:37.551
[gags]

61
00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.803
…and gunpowder just stays in your nose.

62
00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:40.887
Ugh.

63
00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.183
I'd rather be a knight than a pawn anyway.

64
00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:50.105
Or even better. I could be the one
who designs the board in the first place.

65
00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:52.357
[J scoffs]

66
00:03:57.112 --> 00:04:00.323
As for capturing Jeong Jinman.
you need to be the one to do it.

67
00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:05.454
I like the sound of that.

68
00:04:07.581 --> 00:04:08.582
And Q?

69
00:04:09.583 --> 00:04:10.625
Q will…

70
00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:11.710
[sighs]

71
00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:14.838
…get rattled.

72
00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:19.301
I need the one who leads this team
to be someone cold.

73
00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.219
[scoffs]

74
00:04:21.303 --> 00:04:22.429
Hmm…

75
00:04:25.682 --> 00:04:27.267
Women's intuition.

76
00:04:37.444 --> 00:04:42.199
[♪ tense music playing]

77
00:04:47.412 --> 00:04:49.539
[drone whirring]

78
00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:07.891
[metallic clanking]

79
00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.560
[gunfire]

80
00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:15.774
[electric crackling]

81
00:05:22.447 --> 00:05:23.532
[gunshots]

82
00:05:24.783 --> 00:05:25.784
[air hissing]

83
00:05:25.867 --> 00:05:26.868
[mercenary] Smoke!

84
00:05:26.952 --> 00:05:28.662
[J] <i>Don't panic. Hold your positions.</i>

85
00:05:30.497 --> 00:05:32.707
-[gunfire]
-[mercenary grunts]

86
00:05:34.918 --> 00:05:35.919
[loud thud]

87
00:05:38.588 --> 00:05:41.132
[drone whirring]

88
00:05:44.135 --> 00:05:46.721
[Jin] He's the most skilled agent
in your team.

89
00:05:46.805 --> 00:05:49.558
Don't you think it's long overdue
for J to lead a unit?

90
00:05:49.641 --> 00:05:53.854
I don't think it's combat skills
that determines a good leader.

91
00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.817
If the target's Jeong Jinman.
I think it does.

92
00:05:58.900 --> 00:05:59.901
That's not it.

93
00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.738
I'm talking about Bale.

94
00:06:04.906 --> 00:06:06.157
[blows raspberry]

95
00:06:06.241 --> 00:06:08.034
[laughs]

96
00:06:08.118 --> 00:06:10.161
Bale's just a hunting dog at this point.

97
00:06:10.245 --> 00:06:13.248
If you take him off his leash.
he'll find Jinman for us.

98
00:06:13.331 --> 00:06:14.708
We should be using that.

99
00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.048
[♪ tense music playing]

100
00:06:22.132 --> 00:06:23.341
[sighs]

101
00:06:25.886 --> 00:06:26.928
[soft exhale]

102
00:06:27.012 --> 00:06:30.015
[♪ tense music continues]

103
00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:36.605
Working with Bale to capture Jinman
was actually J's choice as team leader.

104
00:06:37.272 --> 00:06:40.025
[Jin] You can't keep coddling him forever
because he's your little brother.

105
00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:41.860
J has the skills he needs.

106
00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:49.284
Branch Chief…

107
00:06:53.371 --> 00:06:55.498
are you and my brother
still seeing each other?

108
00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:58.126
[metallic clanking]

109
00:07:01.004 --> 00:07:02.631
[whirring]

110
00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.343
Heavy radio signal detected.

111
00:07:08.178 --> 00:07:09.387
Remove it.

112
00:07:10.347 --> 00:07:12.265
[Q] <i>If you really cared about Jun…</i>

113
00:07:13.975 --> 00:07:16.645
why stick him with a time bomb like Bale…

114
00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:20.023
and send him after Jeong Jinman?

115
00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:23.610
If you're afraid of things like that.

116
00:07:23.693 --> 00:07:25.779
you're in the wrong line of work entirely.

117
00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:29.574
You should try going back
to being yakuza again.

118
00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.160
Or open a bar in Dotonbori

119
00:07:32.243 --> 00:07:34.412
and leave the dangerous missions to us.

120
00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:37.123
[whirring]

121
00:07:37.207 --> 00:07:38.208
[clanks]

122
00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:46.966
[metallic clanking]

123
00:07:48.843 --> 00:07:50.720
[in Korean] Hey. Japanese.

124
00:07:52.681 --> 00:07:55.183
-[in English] It's a trap.
-What?

125
00:07:56.351 --> 00:07:58.520
[in Korean] If they hid the server
in a place like this.

126
00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:02.148
wouldn't it mean they're prepared
to bolt at any moment?

127
00:08:06.945 --> 00:08:08.405
What are you doing?

128
00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:09.531
Translate it.

129
00:08:10.949 --> 00:08:12.575
[in Japanese] If they hid the server
in a place like this.

130
00:08:12.659 --> 00:08:14.744
wouldn't it mean they're prepared
to bolt at any moment?

131
00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:15.954
That's what he's said.

132
00:08:21.251 --> 00:08:22.544
[in English] Bravo. Tango.

133
00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:23.753
<i>find dead ends of containers</i>

134
00:08:23.837 --> 00:08:26.548
<i>that can be connected</i>
<i>to the current Alpha position.</i>

135
00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:30.135
<i>and identify all trucks. cranes.</i>
<i>and modes of transportation</i>

136
00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:31.886
<i>within a 100-meter radius.</i>

137
00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:34.764
[mercenary] <i>Possible ambush on Tango.</i>

138
00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:37.851
[Jin] <i>J. forget about Tango.</i>

139
00:08:40.311 --> 00:08:43.064
[in Japanese]
Hey. didn't you say it was a trap?

140
00:08:44.899 --> 00:08:46.568
What are you doing? Translate it.

141
00:08:49.237 --> 00:08:51.239
[in Korean]
Hey. didn't you say it was a trap?

142
00:08:53.241 --> 00:08:56.411
If it's a trap. we don't go in?

143
00:08:58.413 --> 00:08:59.539
Are you scared?

144
00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:03.543
[in English] Are you scared?

145
00:09:07.047 --> 00:09:08.048
[J sighs]

146
00:09:08.131 --> 00:09:11.718
[♪ tense music playing]

147
00:09:13.428 --> 00:09:17.515
That's right. the enemy of my enemy
should be my friend.

148
00:09:17.599 --> 00:09:22.062
-[whirring]
-[metal cutting screeching]

149
00:09:25.523 --> 00:09:28.109
[whirring continues]

150
00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.248
[metal cutting screeching continues]

151
00:09:50.215 --> 00:09:51.341
[grunts]

152
00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.803
[fighting grunts]

153
00:09:59.015 --> 00:10:00.141
After you.

154
00:10:05.313 --> 00:10:07.065
[clanking]

155
00:10:07.148 --> 00:10:08.358
Grenade!

156
00:10:08.775 --> 00:10:11.194
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

157
00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:13.780
[explosion]

158
00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:20.328
[both groaning]

159
00:10:20.411 --> 00:10:22.789
[Bale coughs. groans]

160
00:10:22.872 --> 00:10:24.874
[J] Marco. Marco!

161
00:10:32.132 --> 00:10:33.883
[grunting]

162
00:10:35.343 --> 00:10:36.678
[J pants]

163
00:10:36.761 --> 00:10:37.846
[Marco] I'm okay.

164
00:10:37.929 --> 00:10:39.931
[Marco breathing heavily]

165
00:10:41.391 --> 00:10:43.810
[labored breaths]

166
00:10:43.893 --> 00:10:44.978
I'll be right back.

167
00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:47.063
[labored breaths]

168
00:10:47.689 --> 00:10:49.774
Jinman's here. that slick fuck.

169
00:10:59.576 --> 00:11:01.619
Bravo. current location?

170
00:11:01.703 --> 00:11:04.455
-[static crackling]
-[indistinct radio chatter]

171
00:11:16.384 --> 00:11:17.385
After you.

172
00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.013
[scoffs]

173
00:11:38.448 --> 00:11:39.532
[sighs]

174
00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:41.951
It's a trap.

175
00:12:53.314 --> 00:12:54.732
[gunshots]

176
00:12:54.816 --> 00:12:57.277
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

177
00:12:59.404 --> 00:13:00.530
[sighs]

178
00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:01.906
[in Japanese] That hurts!

179
00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:02.991
[grunts]

180
00:13:05.034 --> 00:13:06.035
[pants]

181
00:13:10.999 --> 00:13:12.041
Shit.

182
00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.882
[fighting grunts]

183
00:13:21.634 --> 00:13:23.678
[breathing heavily]

184
00:13:23.761 --> 00:13:25.763
Long time. no see.

185
00:13:25.847 --> 00:13:27.473
Jeong Jinman.

186
00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:30.226
[chuckles]

187
00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.937
[in Japanese]
I'm just sorry we have to meet like this.

188
00:13:33.021 --> 00:13:34.439
[in English] J. don't forget.

189
00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:36.482
We need Jeong Jinman alive.

190
00:13:39.277 --> 00:13:41.696
[fighting grunts]

191
00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:49.787
-[grunts]
-[Jinman breathes heavily]

192
00:13:52.373 --> 00:13:55.501
[♪ suspenseful music continues]

193
00:13:56.919 --> 00:13:58.629
[gunshots]

194
00:13:58.713 --> 00:13:59.964
What the hell's that moron doing?

195
00:14:00.631 --> 00:14:01.924
[Bale grunts]

196
00:14:02.008 --> 00:14:04.218
I told you we have to capture him alive!

197
00:14:04.802 --> 00:14:06.012
-[groans]
-[grunts]

198
00:14:06.095 --> 00:14:09.891
-[Bale breathing heavily]
-[J gurgling]

199
00:14:09.974 --> 00:14:12.602
{\an8}[choking. gurgling]

200
00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:13.728
[J gurgling continues]

201
00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:15.271
[choking]

202
00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.149
I thought I made it clear to you.

203
00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:20.443
If you get in my way. you'll die first.

204
00:14:20.526 --> 00:14:22.528
[choking]

205
00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:24.405
-[angry grunt]
-[groans]

206
00:14:25.948 --> 00:14:26.949
[J wheezes]

207
00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:30.578
[choking]

208
00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.091
[sighs]

209
00:14:43.174 --> 00:14:44.175
Shit.

210
00:14:47.136 --> 00:14:48.304
[Jin sighs]

211
00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:52.433
Ugh…

212
00:14:56.562 --> 00:14:57.730
[sighs]

213
00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:01.651
Move it.

214
00:15:02.151 --> 00:15:05.029
[♪ light action music playing]

215
00:15:11.077 --> 00:15:12.203
Shit.

216
00:15:24.841 --> 00:15:26.801
[groaning]

217
00:15:26.884 --> 00:15:27.885
[drone whirs]

218
00:15:27.969 --> 00:15:29.971
Look! Over there!

219
00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:34.934
[rapid gunfire]

220
00:15:35.017 --> 00:15:38.146
[strained grunting]

221
00:15:38.229 --> 00:15:40.106
[grunts. pants]

222
00:15:44.986 --> 00:15:47.530
[gunshots]

223
00:15:47.613 --> 00:15:49.323
Snipers. what are you doing?

224
00:15:49.407 --> 00:15:52.577
Hurry up and stop that truck.
Move to ten o'clock now!

225
00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.954
[low mechanical rumbling]

226
00:15:55.913 --> 00:15:58.583
[heavy thudding]

227
00:16:08.342 --> 00:16:09.468
[Brother cries out]

228
00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:15.725
[Brother breathing heavily]

229
00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:17.852
[Cheolseung]
We're out of time. let's haul ass!

230
00:16:18.644 --> 00:16:20.897
[engine starts rumbling]

231
00:16:22.857 --> 00:16:25.610
You always did have something up
your sleeve. Jinman.

232
00:16:26.819 --> 00:16:27.820
[clicks]

233
00:16:27.904 --> 00:16:29.530
Always so petty.

234
00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:38.915
-[fighting grunts]
-[gunshots]

235
00:16:38.998 --> 00:16:40.374
[grunts]

236
00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:43.085
[Jinman panting]

237
00:16:47.798 --> 00:16:50.718
[fighting grunts]

238
00:16:55.806 --> 00:16:57.183
[yells]

239
00:17:02.188 --> 00:17:04.774
[♪ soft tense music playing]

240
00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.276
[Brother groans]

241
00:17:08.611 --> 00:17:11.864
[engine rumbling]

242
00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:13.199
Just ram through it!

243
00:17:13.282 --> 00:17:14.867
Hold on to something!

244
00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.829
[loud crashing]

245
00:17:18.913 --> 00:17:19.956
[both grunt]

246
00:17:24.043 --> 00:17:26.545
[Jinman breathing heavily]

247
00:17:28.172 --> 00:17:30.466
[fighting grunts]

248
00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:31.926
[Jinman yells in pain]

249
00:17:32.009 --> 00:17:33.678
-[Jinman grunts]
-[yells out in pain]

250
00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:37.014
[growling. grunting]

251
00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.184
[strained grunting]

252
00:17:40.268 --> 00:17:43.020
-[Jinman grunts]
-[breathing heavily]

253
00:17:43.104 --> 00:17:45.147
[fighting grunts]

254
00:17:45.231 --> 00:17:47.400
[ragged breathing]

255
00:17:56.826 --> 00:17:58.369
-[Jinman grunts]
-[pained groan]

256
00:17:58.452 --> 00:17:59.912
[loud thud]

257
00:17:59.996 --> 00:18:02.707
[ragged breathing]

258
00:18:04.792 --> 00:18:07.378
[Bale gasps. pants]

259
00:18:09.755 --> 00:18:11.173
[Bale breathes heavily]

260
00:18:11.257 --> 00:18:12.758
[exhales]

261
00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:14.969
[Bale] All these clever little tricks

262
00:18:15.511 --> 00:18:18.097
are only gonna blow up in your face.

263
00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.599
[exhales]

264
00:18:20.182 --> 00:18:21.183
[exhales]

265
00:18:23.853 --> 00:18:25.021
-[gasps]
-[beeps]

266
00:18:25.104 --> 00:18:26.480
[explosion]

267
00:18:53.966 --> 00:18:55.718
[Bale wheezing]

268
00:19:07.897 --> 00:19:10.107
[breathing softly]

269
00:19:10.191 --> 00:19:13.944
Jeong Jinman. I'll see you in hell--

270
00:19:14.028 --> 00:19:15.863
[gunshots]

271
00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:21.160
[♪ dark upbeat music playing]

272
00:19:21.243 --> 00:19:22.244
[gun clicks]

273
00:19:37.385 --> 00:19:38.552
[sighs]

274
00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.103
[Jin] Tell me.

275
00:19:47.186 --> 00:19:49.271
are we being recorded
in the command center?

276
00:19:49.355 --> 00:19:50.523
No. ma'am.

277
00:19:50.606 --> 00:19:53.067
We don't record
unofficial internal operations.

278
00:19:53.943 --> 00:19:55.027
[sighs quietly]

279
00:19:55.111 --> 00:19:56.696
Good work. everybody.

280
00:19:57.488 --> 00:19:58.614
You can all go home.

281
00:20:05.162 --> 00:20:07.039
Q's operation is in a few hours.

282
00:20:07.123 --> 00:20:08.290
What's our angle here?

283
00:20:08.374 --> 00:20:09.375
Hmm…

284
00:20:09.458 --> 00:20:10.710
I'll figure something out.

285
00:20:11.419 --> 00:20:13.087
[sighs] I'm starving.

286
00:20:18.676 --> 00:20:19.802
Can you handle it?

287
00:20:20.678 --> 00:20:23.222
[♪ soft tense music playing]

288
00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.142
[guard sighs deeply]

289
00:20:26.225 --> 00:20:28.227
[engine idling]

290
00:20:31.939 --> 00:20:33.190
[sighs]

291
00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:35.151
[beeps]

292
00:20:41.824 --> 00:20:42.825
[sighs]

293
00:20:44.577 --> 00:20:46.036
Can I get room service?

294
00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:49.290
Even though Bale's a psycho.
how could he kill his own team like that?

295
00:20:50.207 --> 00:20:52.501
Dying like a dog as soon
as you leave Japan…

296
00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.421
I heard that J was Q's younger brother.

297
00:20:56.881 --> 00:20:57.965
[sighs]

298
00:20:59.175 --> 00:21:01.719
[♪ soft tense music playing]

299
00:21:01.802 --> 00:21:03.804
[engine rumbling]

300
00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:05.473
[tires squeal]

301
00:21:11.395 --> 00:21:15.232
[fighting grunts]

302
00:21:15.816 --> 00:21:16.984
[J in Japanese] <i>That hurts!</i>

303
00:21:20.237 --> 00:21:21.238
[Jinman pants]

304
00:21:25.242 --> 00:21:26.577
[grunts. pants]

305
00:21:28.078 --> 00:21:29.413
[phone buzzing]

306
00:21:30.039 --> 00:21:31.207
[buzzing continues]

307
00:21:32.917 --> 00:21:34.835
-Yeah?
-[K] <i>Everything is set.</i>

308
00:21:35.377 --> 00:21:37.588
<i>But there are two employees</i>
<i>from another department</i>

309
00:21:37.671 --> 00:21:39.006
<i>and the bus driver on board.</i>

310
00:21:39.089 --> 00:21:40.216
[gasps]

311
00:21:41.467 --> 00:21:42.843
I think that…

312
00:21:44.261 --> 00:21:46.514
looks more natural. don't you think?

313
00:21:46.597 --> 00:21:48.766
[engine rumbling]

314
00:21:50.226 --> 00:21:51.727
[explosion]

315
00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.566
[Jin] <i>Whoo! </i>[chuckles]

316
00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.235
<i>Good job. K.</i>

317
00:21:59.318 --> 00:22:02.154
[♪ tense music playing]

318
00:22:07.827 --> 00:22:08.911
<i>You understand?</i>

319
00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:11.956
<i>Jeong Jinman was the one who killed J.</i>

320
00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:13.374
Bale didn't do it.

321
00:22:14.416 --> 00:22:16.836
We have to make sure
that Q never discovers the truth

322
00:22:16.919 --> 00:22:18.963
under any circumstances.

323
00:22:20.548 --> 00:22:23.551
<i>This… stays between us.</i>

324
00:22:24.260 --> 00:22:26.679
[♪ tense music continues]

325
00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:37.106
[crickets chirping]

326
00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:43.737
[driver] Fortunately.
the residents had all left the island.

327
00:22:44.405 --> 00:22:47.741
Your friend Miss Arin rushed to Seoul
because of her uncle's sudden passing.

328
00:22:48.325 --> 00:22:50.578
And it looks like she won't be able
to come back.

329
00:22:51.787 --> 00:22:53.581
We'll make it
so nothing happened here tonight.

330
00:22:53.664 --> 00:22:56.375
So. as long as you keep quiet.
that's the end of it.

331
00:22:56.458 --> 00:22:58.627
You'll be free to return
to your normal life.

332
00:22:58.711 --> 00:22:59.920
However.

333
00:23:00.004 --> 00:23:02.882
once Miss Jian leaves here.
you'll be strangers from that moment on.

334
00:23:02.965 --> 00:23:04.091
Any contact is forbidden.

335
00:23:04.174 --> 00:23:05.718
Hey. I don't think that's necess…

336
00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:09.221
That's going too far.

337
00:23:11.807 --> 00:23:12.975
Woojin…

338
00:23:13.058 --> 00:23:14.268
[gasps]

339
00:23:14.977 --> 00:23:16.228
[Woojin breathes shakily]

340
00:23:17.771 --> 00:23:21.025
[driver] If you need help.
you can contact me at this number.

341
00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:24.820
CO.. Ltd. JAEWON CLEANING
Team Leader Kim Jaewon

342
00:23:34.204 --> 00:23:36.790
[door slides open. shut]

343
00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:44.673
[breathes shakily]

344
00:23:55.434 --> 00:23:56.435
[Woojin] Arin…

345
00:23:58.228 --> 00:23:59.438
No.

346
00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:02.232
Your real name is…

347
00:24:04.318 --> 00:24:05.778
Jian. isn't it?

348
00:24:08.989 --> 00:24:11.075
[breathes shakily]

349
00:24:16.372 --> 00:24:18.457
I don't think
I'll be any help cleaning here.

350
00:24:20.459 --> 00:24:21.961
Let me know when it's all done.

351
00:24:24.296 --> 00:24:25.547
I'll be at the house.

352
00:24:29.218 --> 00:24:30.469
Woojin. wait.

353
00:24:36.934 --> 00:24:40.354
[♪ soft piano music playing]

354
00:24:41.563 --> 00:24:43.273
[door slides open]

355
00:24:45.985 --> 00:24:47.111
[door slides shut]

356
00:24:48.278 --> 00:24:50.698
-[crickets chirping]
-[♪ soft piano music continues]

357
00:24:53.575 --> 00:24:54.576
[door opens]

358
00:24:55.494 --> 00:24:57.997
[footsteps approaching]

359
00:25:08.924 --> 00:25:11.593
Do you think it's okay to let him leave.
just like that?

360
00:25:12.761 --> 00:25:15.431
There are traces of him
having accessed the app data.

361
00:25:26.191 --> 00:25:29.319
When you catch up. what are you gonna say?

362
00:25:53.260 --> 00:25:54.470
[Minhye] That boy Woojin…

363
00:25:55.637 --> 00:25:56.680
do you like him?

364
00:26:01.769 --> 00:26:03.228
Stay level-headed.

365
00:26:03.312 --> 00:26:05.314
You remember Bae Jeongmin. right?

366
00:26:05.898 --> 00:26:08.692
-We don't know who'll come looking and--
-[Jian] <i>Unni…</i>

367
00:26:09.526 --> 00:26:10.861
I'm really hungry.

368
00:26:15.699 --> 00:26:17.451
Why don't we eat something?

369
00:26:18.077 --> 00:26:19.578
We got some <i>mumallaengi.</i>

370
00:26:19.661 --> 00:26:22.873
Auntie Soonae grows the radishes.
dries and seasons them herself.

371
00:26:22.956 --> 00:26:24.124
It's so good.

372
00:26:24.917 --> 00:26:28.212
And these are <i>bangiip muchin</i> and <i>myeolchi</i>
that Auntie Pilsun made.

373
00:26:28.837 --> 00:26:29.838
And this one…

374
00:26:29.922 --> 00:26:31.757
[chuckles]

375
00:26:31.840 --> 00:26:35.260
Auntie Jeomrye. she found out
I liked sausage and stir-fried vegetables.

376
00:26:35.344 --> 00:26:36.512
so she made this for me.

377
00:26:37.054 --> 00:26:38.514
Ah… [gasps softly]

378
00:26:38.597 --> 00:26:39.932
<i>Meongge-jeot…</i>

379
00:26:40.516 --> 00:26:42.226
Auntie Jeomrye's specialty.

380
00:26:52.528 --> 00:26:53.529
Jian.

381
00:26:54.696 --> 00:26:56.824
we don't have time to be doing this.

382
00:26:59.618 --> 00:27:00.619
[soft thud]

383
00:27:03.163 --> 00:27:04.248
This stuff…

384
00:27:08.335 --> 00:27:09.419
I've never…

385
00:27:09.920 --> 00:27:11.046
[inhales deeply]

386
00:27:11.588 --> 00:27:14.091
I never got to just be like this
with Uncle.

387
00:27:14.174 --> 00:27:15.259
[cries softly]

388
00:27:21.932 --> 00:27:23.267
After getting here…

389
00:27:24.268 --> 00:27:27.980
living a normal life like everyone else.
it was just really nice.

390
00:27:29.231 --> 00:27:30.941
Having someone there for me…

391
00:27:32.734 --> 00:27:34.611
and me being there for them too.

392
00:27:36.947 --> 00:27:38.282
Laughing together.

393
00:27:39.366 --> 00:27:40.450
making meals.

394
00:27:41.243 --> 00:27:42.286
just talking…

395
00:27:44.621 --> 00:27:45.664
normal.

396
00:27:48.292 --> 00:27:50.002
A normal life. you know?

397
00:27:53.714 --> 00:27:55.549
[sighs heavily]

398
00:27:56.800 --> 00:28:00.137
[cries] Living a normal life
like everyone else gets to.

399
00:28:00.220 --> 00:28:02.097
[cries. exhales]

400
00:28:03.640 --> 00:28:04.641
[inhales]

401
00:28:04.725 --> 00:28:06.351
Until yesterday. I really…

402
00:28:07.311 --> 00:28:08.312
[sighs]

403
00:28:08.395 --> 00:28:10.856
…really believed
I could keep going like this.

404
00:28:11.982 --> 00:28:13.609
Look. your uncle really tried.

405
00:28:14.276 --> 00:28:16.445
He did everything he could for you. Jian.

406
00:28:16.528 --> 00:28:18.363
I know he did. I know that.

407
00:28:18.447 --> 00:28:19.865
[cries]

408
00:28:22.701 --> 00:28:23.702
[sniffles]

409
00:28:24.870 --> 00:28:26.121
[inhales]

410
00:28:26.204 --> 00:28:29.207
I found a way here
to live life on my own terms.

411
00:28:30.292 --> 00:28:33.837
It's better than that cage he kept me in
'cause it was dangerous.

412
00:28:33.921 --> 00:28:36.048
And that was his past catching up to us.

413
00:28:37.007 --> 00:28:38.967
It had nothing at all to do with me.

414
00:28:39.051 --> 00:28:40.135
[inhales]

415
00:28:43.221 --> 00:28:44.348
Even still…

416
00:28:46.350 --> 00:28:50.145
if you were to stay here.
Woojin and everyone around you

417
00:28:50.812 --> 00:28:52.147
will all be in danger.

418
00:28:53.732 --> 00:28:55.067
[breathes shakily]

419
00:28:55.150 --> 00:28:56.151
I know that.

420
00:28:57.027 --> 00:28:58.737
[breathes deeply]

421
00:29:01.031 --> 00:29:02.991
[sighs. sniffles]

422
00:29:03.533 --> 00:29:05.661
I'll go back to my uncle. I just…

423
00:29:09.873 --> 00:29:10.916
[sighs]

424
00:29:12.125 --> 00:29:13.168
Could we just…

425
00:29:16.254 --> 00:29:17.464
have one moment?

426
00:29:17.547 --> 00:29:18.590
[inhales]

427
00:29:20.258 --> 00:29:22.678
Can we have one more meal
as normal people first?

428
00:29:26.890 --> 00:29:28.225
[Woojin sighs]

429
00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:32.521
[glass shattering]

430
00:29:41.488 --> 00:29:44.032
[♪ action tense music playing]

431
00:30:01.800 --> 00:30:04.219
[drone whirring]

432
00:30:04.302 --> 00:30:06.555
[♪ action tense music continues]

433
00:30:24.406 --> 00:30:26.199
WOOJIN

434
00:30:26.283 --> 00:30:28.702
[phone buzzing]

435
00:30:43.550 --> 00:30:45.469
[panting]

436
00:30:45.552 --> 00:30:50.182
[engines rumbling]

437
00:30:52.476 --> 00:30:53.894
[panting]

438
00:30:55.353 --> 00:30:56.646
[engine starts. revs]

439
00:30:56.730 --> 00:30:59.191
[engine revving]

440
00:30:59.274 --> 00:31:01.943
Team Leader. she isn't alone.
How should we handle this?

441
00:31:02.819 --> 00:31:04.529
You can eliminate anyone
who gets in your way.

442
00:31:04.613 --> 00:31:05.614
Just get her.

443
00:31:07.949 --> 00:31:08.950
[suppressed gunshot]

444
00:31:20.337 --> 00:31:21.838
-[whirring]
-[rattling]

445
00:31:22.881 --> 00:31:24.591
[suppressed gunshots]

446
00:31:24.674 --> 00:31:26.927
[engines rumbling]

447
00:31:33.683 --> 00:31:36.728
[gasping]

448
00:31:36.812 --> 00:31:38.522
[Minhye] And for our extraction?

449
00:31:38.605 --> 00:31:40.315
[Jaewon] We can transport you on our ship.

450
00:31:41.399 --> 00:31:42.526
[clanks]

451
00:31:43.110 --> 00:31:44.111
[Woojin] This is bad.

452
00:31:44.194 --> 00:31:45.237
You have to go now!

453
00:31:45.320 --> 00:31:48.198
[engines rumbling]

454
00:31:55.997 --> 00:31:58.500
Woojin. is there another way to the docks?

455
00:31:59.042 --> 00:32:01.086
On the back side of the island.
there's a way there.

456
00:32:01.169 --> 00:32:02.212
Listen carefully.

457
00:32:02.295 --> 00:32:04.381
I'll stay and stall them as long as I can.

458
00:32:04.464 --> 00:32:06.174
Head to the docks with Woojin.

459
00:32:06.716 --> 00:32:09.427
Once you get down there.
find the boat called the<i> JW.</i>

460
00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:11.930
Director Kim. give them cover.

461
00:32:12.013 --> 00:32:13.348
Right. I'm on it.

462
00:32:15.475 --> 00:32:18.854
[engines rumbling]

463
00:32:24.484 --> 00:32:25.735
-[gun clicks]
-[sighs]

464
00:32:25.819 --> 00:32:26.820
<i>Unni.</i>

465
00:32:32.951 --> 00:32:34.077
[in English] I'll be fine.

466
00:32:34.828 --> 00:32:38.039
Listen. your <i>unni</i> will never die.

467
00:32:38.665 --> 00:32:41.126
[♪ action tense music playing]

468
00:32:57.058 --> 00:33:00.312
[engine rumbling]

469
00:33:05.734 --> 00:33:06.860
They're coming!

470
00:33:07.986 --> 00:33:09.988
[rapid gunfire]

471
00:33:29.174 --> 00:33:30.300
[breathes sharply]

472
00:33:30.383 --> 00:33:32.135
[panting]

473
00:33:34.304 --> 00:33:37.641
[drone whirring]

474
00:33:38.433 --> 00:33:39.559
[gunshots]

475
00:33:39.643 --> 00:33:40.685
[Jaewon yells]

476
00:33:42.062 --> 00:33:44.773
[engines revving]

477
00:33:51.363 --> 00:33:52.364
[groans]

478
00:33:54.115 --> 00:33:55.909
[explosion]

479
00:34:01.706 --> 00:34:03.250
[gasps]

480
00:34:06.169 --> 00:34:08.713
[breathing shakily]

481
00:34:08.797 --> 00:34:11.341
[engine rumbling]

482
00:34:11.424 --> 00:34:15.053
Team Leader. there's a four-wheeler
headed towards the docks.

483
00:34:15.136 --> 00:34:16.471
It looks like Jeong Jian.

484
00:34:23.520 --> 00:34:25.480
Bravo. start making your way in.

485
00:34:25.563 --> 00:34:26.564
Let's roll out.

486
00:34:30.277 --> 00:34:31.945
[engines rumbling]

487
00:34:35.991 --> 00:34:37.409
[explosion]

488
00:34:37.492 --> 00:34:38.660
[thuds]

489
00:34:41.579 --> 00:34:43.999
[♪ low suspenseful music playing]

490
00:34:53.717 --> 00:34:55.802
[rapid gunfire]

491
00:35:16.323 --> 00:35:17.949
[gunfire]

492
00:35:25.665 --> 00:35:26.666
[Minhye clicks tongue]

493
00:35:34.883 --> 00:35:35.967
[strained grunting]

494
00:35:40.680 --> 00:35:41.681
[grunts]

495
00:35:43.183 --> 00:35:44.643
[pants]

496
00:35:44.726 --> 00:35:46.061
[groaning in pain]

497
00:35:46.645 --> 00:35:47.646
Are you all right?

498
00:35:47.729 --> 00:35:49.189
[sighs]

499
00:35:49.272 --> 00:35:51.274
-[sighs softly]
-[gun clicks]

500
00:35:51.941 --> 00:35:53.818
We have to hurry and catch up to Jian.

501
00:35:53.902 --> 00:35:56.321
[♪ tense music playing]

502
00:36:02.243 --> 00:36:03.370
-Woojin!
-[gasps]

503
00:36:05.538 --> 00:36:07.749
-[drone whirring]
-[engines rumbling]

504
00:36:12.504 --> 00:36:13.630
-[loud blast]
-[yelps]

505
00:36:15.590 --> 00:36:16.758
[engine revs]

506
00:36:27.769 --> 00:36:30.230
[♪ muffled tense music playing]

507
00:36:30.313 --> 00:36:32.399
[breathing deeply]

508
00:36:32.899 --> 00:36:34.526
[Jian inhales deeply]

509
00:36:34.859 --> 00:36:36.528
[gunfire]

510
00:36:42.701 --> 00:36:43.702
[loud blast]

511
00:36:44.911 --> 00:36:46.204
[gasps]

512
00:36:46.705 --> 00:36:48.498
[drone whirring]

513
00:36:50.041 --> 00:36:51.084
[grunts]

514
00:36:54.587 --> 00:36:56.381
[gunfire]

515
00:37:19.654 --> 00:37:20.989
Arin. hold on to me!

516
00:37:21.614 --> 00:37:24.784
[♪ tense music continues]

517
00:37:27.829 --> 00:37:29.456
[tires screech]

518
00:37:36.045 --> 00:37:38.548
[engines rumbling]

519
00:38:02.822 --> 00:38:03.948
[brakes grinding]

520
00:38:04.032 --> 00:38:05.325
[tires screech]

521
00:38:14.584 --> 00:38:18.254
[♪ tense music continues]

522
00:38:27.430 --> 00:38:28.681
-[tires screech]
-[groans]

523
00:38:29.349 --> 00:38:30.809
-[Woojin exclaims]
-[Jian grunts]

524
00:38:30.892 --> 00:38:32.393
-[tires screech]
-[brakes grinding]

525
00:38:33.937 --> 00:38:35.897
[moans. grunts]

526
00:38:35.980 --> 00:38:37.190
-[Woojin] Arin…
-[grunts]

527
00:38:38.107 --> 00:38:40.360
[breathing raggedly]

528
00:38:55.708 --> 00:38:57.085
Arin. get up.

529
00:38:57.168 --> 00:38:58.461
[Jian grunts]

530
00:38:58.545 --> 00:39:00.129
[Q] Jeong Jian…

531
00:39:01.089 --> 00:39:03.466
[Jian grunts raggedly]

532
00:39:04.217 --> 00:39:07.220
Wait. is that your boat over there?

533
00:39:07.303 --> 00:39:08.388
[Jian breathes shakily]

534
00:39:08.471 --> 00:39:10.473
-[explosion]
-[both gasp]

535
00:39:12.392 --> 00:39:14.185
[pants. gasps]

536
00:39:15.270 --> 00:39:16.729
[inhales sharply] You can't!

537
00:39:18.565 --> 00:39:20.441
[breathing heavily]

538
00:39:20.525 --> 00:39:21.526
Shit.

539
00:39:21.609 --> 00:39:22.944
[breathing heavily]

540
00:39:23.027 --> 00:39:24.904
[Q] This is your last chance.

541
00:39:26.865 --> 00:39:29.576
[Jian breathing heavily]

542
00:39:30.368 --> 00:39:34.414
If you don't come with me. your boyfriend
will also die just like that.

543
00:39:34.497 --> 00:39:37.542
-[Jian breathing shakily]
-[chuckles softly]

544
00:39:41.045 --> 00:39:42.422
[engine revving]

545
00:39:43.965 --> 00:39:45.884
[♪ action tense music playing]

546
00:39:46.676 --> 00:39:47.677
[engine revs]

547
00:39:51.931 --> 00:39:53.683
[tires screeching]

548
00:39:55.393 --> 00:39:56.769
-[tires screech]
-[engine revs]

549
00:39:58.438 --> 00:39:59.522
[grunts softly]

550
00:40:00.982 --> 00:40:02.859
-[gunfire]
-[grunts]

551
00:40:02.942 --> 00:40:04.193
[strained grunt]

552
00:40:04.777 --> 00:40:06.446
[rapid gunfire]

553
00:40:06.821 --> 00:40:08.531
[breathing heavily]

554
00:40:10.283 --> 00:40:11.492
Hey. my boat's right there.

555
00:40:11.576 --> 00:40:12.785
[Jian grunts]

556
00:40:12.869 --> 00:40:14.579
[Jian breathing heavily]

557
00:40:19.250 --> 00:40:21.169
[engine rumbling]

558
00:40:28.343 --> 00:40:30.470
[panting]

559
00:40:42.190 --> 00:40:43.650
[gasps awake]

560
00:40:54.535 --> 00:40:57.997
-[tires screech]
-[engine revving]

561
00:41:02.961 --> 00:41:04.963
[♪ dark tense music playing]

562
00:41:09.175 --> 00:41:11.135
[engine revving]

563
00:41:12.679 --> 00:41:14.013
[yells]

564
00:41:20.561 --> 00:41:21.771
[water splashes]

565
00:41:26.359 --> 00:41:27.944
[panting]

566
00:41:30.113 --> 00:41:31.489
You're her. huh?

567
00:41:32.699 --> 00:41:34.117
So Minhye.

568
00:41:41.791 --> 00:41:44.085
[♪ dark tense music continues]

569
00:41:44.168 --> 00:41:46.504
[both grunting]

570
00:41:48.297 --> 00:41:49.298
[grunts]

571
00:41:52.468 --> 00:41:53.469
[fierce grunt]

572
00:42:01.978 --> 00:42:03.271
[both grunt]

573
00:42:04.605 --> 00:42:05.815
[yells]

574
00:42:05.898 --> 00:42:07.066
[pants]

575
00:42:08.609 --> 00:42:10.236
[breathes heavily]

576
00:42:16.284 --> 00:42:17.326
[both grunt]

577
00:42:17.410 --> 00:42:19.120
Woojin. hard left now!

578
00:42:19.203 --> 00:42:20.204
[rattling]

579
00:42:20.288 --> 00:42:21.456
[Q pants]

580
00:42:26.127 --> 00:42:27.754
[engine rumbling]

581
00:42:30.423 --> 00:42:31.424
[Woojin grunts]

582
00:42:37.889 --> 00:42:40.016
[Q panting]

583
00:42:58.117 --> 00:42:59.118
[grunts]

584
00:43:01.579 --> 00:43:03.581
[breathing heavily]

585
00:43:06.626 --> 00:43:07.668
Seal it off.

586
00:43:12.507 --> 00:43:14.133
[whooshes]

587
00:43:33.653 --> 00:43:37.156
[Woojin breathing shakily]

588
00:43:41.494 --> 00:43:43.246
[breathing shakily continues]

589
00:43:49.377 --> 00:43:51.754
[Jian sighs. sniffles]

590
00:43:53.589 --> 00:43:54.757
I'm sorry. Woojin.

591
00:43:58.594 --> 00:43:59.595
[thuds]

592
00:44:01.973 --> 00:44:03.182
[Woojin] I'm doing fine.

593
00:44:03.975 --> 00:44:05.643
Look. I'm still in one piece.

594
00:44:06.936 --> 00:44:07.979
So don't worry.

595
00:44:10.398 --> 00:44:12.108
[Jian crying]

596
00:44:12.191 --> 00:44:13.734
Hey. don't say you forgot.

597
00:44:14.610 --> 00:44:16.946
-do you remember my promise?
-[crying]

598
00:44:17.029 --> 00:44:18.156
[Woojin] In Hanam-do.

599
00:44:18.990 --> 00:44:20.199
I won't let anyone

600
00:44:21.117 --> 00:44:22.660
touch even a hair on your head.

601
00:44:24.120 --> 00:44:25.496
[crying softly]

602
00:44:29.417 --> 00:44:31.627
[♪ soft music playing]

603
00:44:36.174 --> 00:44:37.758
I won't let them get the chance.

604
00:44:41.387 --> 00:44:42.388
[sniffles]

605
00:44:44.640 --> 00:44:45.641
You're right.

606
00:44:46.309 --> 00:44:47.977
They won't have a chance in hell.

607
00:45:02.116 --> 00:45:03.367
[exhales softly]

608
00:45:05.203 --> 00:45:06.746
[♪ tense music playing]

609
00:45:08.122 --> 00:45:10.124
Jian. get down!

610
00:45:10.666 --> 00:45:12.376
{\an8}-[rapid beeping]
-[gunshots]

611
00:45:13.669 --> 00:45:14.670
Boom.

612
00:45:14.754 --> 00:45:16.881
[explosion]

613
00:45:38.527 --> 00:45:42.031
Give them a warning shot. to wake them up.

614
00:45:44.992 --> 00:45:46.077
Woojin. drop down!

615
00:45:46.160 --> 00:45:48.162
[rapid gunfire]

616
00:45:53.459 --> 00:45:56.462
[gunshots]

617
00:45:58.005 --> 00:45:59.924
[rapid gunfire]

618
00:46:06.013 --> 00:46:07.014
[glass shattering]

619
00:46:07.098 --> 00:46:09.475
[Woojin breathing heavily]

620
00:46:10.893 --> 00:46:12.603
Woojin. Woojin!

621
00:46:12.687 --> 00:46:14.313
[Jian panting]

622
00:46:15.481 --> 00:46:17.400
It's okay. Just wait a second.

623
00:46:19.652 --> 00:46:22.488
[Jian panting]

624
00:46:22.571 --> 00:46:23.948
[gunfire]

625
00:46:24.031 --> 00:46:25.283
Jeong Jian!

626
00:46:27.868 --> 00:46:29.912
[Q] <i>I want Jeong Jian brought in alive.</i>

627
00:46:30.496 --> 00:46:31.872
[cries softly]

628
00:46:31.956 --> 00:46:33.165
Jian. hey…

629
00:46:36.877 --> 00:46:37.962
[weakly] Jeong Jian.

630
00:46:40.172 --> 00:46:42.300
[crying]

631
00:46:44.093 --> 00:46:45.761
[Jian breathes shakily]

632
00:46:48.723 --> 00:46:49.849
[cries]

633
00:46:51.475 --> 00:46:53.602
[breathes shakily]

634
00:46:53.686 --> 00:46:55.688
[♪ somber music playing]

635
00:46:56.188 --> 00:46:57.648
That's your name. right?

636
00:46:58.190 --> 00:46:59.275
[inhales sharply]

637
00:47:00.318 --> 00:47:01.485
Jeong Jian?

638
00:47:02.153 --> 00:47:04.363
[crying]

639
00:47:05.614 --> 00:47:06.824
Uh-huh.

640
00:47:07.658 --> 00:47:10.703
[sobbing]

641
00:47:11.996 --> 00:47:14.457
[Jian crying]

642
00:47:16.208 --> 00:47:18.127
Even your name is beautiful. Jian.

643
00:47:22.131 --> 00:47:23.674
-[sniffles. cries]
-I…

644
00:47:27.762 --> 00:47:29.764
-[mumbles]
-[Jian crying]

645
00:47:31.015 --> 00:47:32.683
Hey. didn't I promise you?

646
00:47:34.101 --> 00:47:35.561
Not a single hair.

647
00:47:36.145 --> 00:47:38.189
Not a single hair on your head.

648
00:47:38.272 --> 00:47:40.274
[sobbing]

649
00:47:44.445 --> 00:47:45.654
Let me just say…

650
00:47:48.324 --> 00:47:49.867
thanks for hanging out…

651
00:47:52.912 --> 00:47:54.622
with a hick like me.

652
00:47:57.625 --> 00:47:58.709
[gasps]

653
00:48:07.426 --> 00:48:09.678
[Jian sobbing]

654
00:48:14.016 --> 00:48:15.434
Woojin. hey!

655
00:48:16.185 --> 00:48:17.561
Don't close your eyes!

656
00:48:17.645 --> 00:48:19.146
No! You can't…

657
00:48:19.230 --> 00:48:21.023
[sobbing]

658
00:48:21.774 --> 00:48:23.109
You can't…

659
00:48:26.695 --> 00:48:29.281
[sobbing continues]

660
00:48:30.074 --> 00:48:31.659
[rapid gunfire]

661
00:48:31.742 --> 00:48:33.452
Jeong Jinman!

662
00:48:36.622 --> 00:48:39.333
Jeong Jinman!

663
00:48:41.085 --> 00:48:47.925
[inaudible] Jeong Jinman!

664
00:48:48.008 --> 00:48:50.928
[♪ somber music continues]

665
00:48:52.012 --> 00:48:54.098
[rapid gunfire]

666
00:48:54.181 --> 00:48:55.391
[explosion]

667
00:49:01.730 --> 00:49:03.441
[helicopter blades whirring]

668
00:49:09.989 --> 00:49:11.991
[rapid gunfire]

669
00:49:17.705 --> 00:49:19.206
[explosion]

670
00:49:21.250 --> 00:49:23.461
[breathes shakily]

671
00:49:24.753 --> 00:49:27.298
[helicopter whirring overhead]

672
00:49:31.302 --> 00:49:33.387
[exhales in relief]

673
00:49:34.597 --> 00:49:37.808
[crying]

674
00:49:44.356 --> 00:49:49.153
A SHOP FOR KILLERS 2

675
